{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror x Thriller x Fantasy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal 2D side-scrolling puzzle-adventure.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for clues: To reveal the truth of old cases.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a bizarre and curious world and start a fantastical adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Children in the apartment complex are searching for their missing friend, unwittingly becoming entangled in a decade-long murder case. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents, while avoiding the topic, whisper terrifying rumors behind closed doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among them are a strange landlord couple, a murderer living in the penthouse, siblings traumatized by witnessing their mother's suicide, a creepy doctor practicing medicine illegally, and a grocery store owner obsessed with collecting shrouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question looms : who is the perpetrator of these horrifying crimes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden in the dark corners of the apartment lies a secret unknown to all\u2014a tragic box reeking of death and the disturbing sound of crying echoing in the hallways.After tonight, the truth may be buried forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2223260?t=1758186824","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2223260?t=1758186824","capsule_imag